{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","蚀骨之箭"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","암흑의 화살"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成持续伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 지속 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","发射蚀骨之箭，对一名敌人造成150% + 20% ATK伤害，使其附带“箭毒”效果 ，并对附带“箭毒”的目标每秒造成30% ATK伤害，直至目标被击败。“箭毒”效果无法被驱散。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","암흑의 화살을 발사하여 적 1명에게 150% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 독화살 효과를 부여한다. 독화살을 맞은 목표에게 초당 30% ATK의 대미지를 입히며, 목표를 처치할 때까지 지속된다. 독화살 효과는 제거할 수 없다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":58,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":76,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每当一名附带“箭毒”的敌方角色被击败，自身回复600点能量。若被击败角色为召唤物，则能量回复量下降至200点。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","독화살을 맞은 적 유닛 1명을 처치할 때마다 자신은 600의 에너지를 회복한다. 처치된 유닛이 소환물이면 에너지 회복량이 200(으)로 감소한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 200% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至225% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 225% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至250% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 250% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","穿心连射"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","연속 관통"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成三次普通攻击伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 3회 일반 공격 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成3次60% + 5% ATK伤害，本技能视为普通攻击。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 60% + 5% ATK의 대미지를 3회 입히며, 해당 스킬은 일반 공격으로 간주한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提高至62% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","회당 대미지가 62% + 5% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提高至65% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","회당 대미지가 65% + 5% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提高至70% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","회당 대미지가 70% + 5% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","腐伤追溢"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","타락한 추월"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","普通攻击命中附带“箭毒”的目标，提升“箭毒”的持续伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","일반 공격으로 독화살을 맞은 목표를 명중하면 독화살의 지속 대미지가 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击将会优先攻击最近的附带自身“箭毒”的目标。当普通攻击命中附带“箭毒”的目标时，将会使目标身上的“箭毒”原始伤害量永久提升25%，最多叠加20 + 2次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","일반 공격 시 독화살이 부여된 가장 가까운 적을 우선 공격한다. 일반 공격으로 독화살이 부여된 목표를 명중하면 목표의 독화살 기본 대미지량이 25% 영구 증가한다(최대 20 + 2스택 중첩 가능)."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":96,"end":100,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":70,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击与终极技能的攻击距离提升至7格。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","일반 공격과 궁극기의 공격 거리가 7칸으로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“箭毒”伤害提升量增加至27%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","독화살 대미지 증가량이 27%로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“箭毒”伤害提升量增加至29%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","독화살 대미지 증가량이 29%로 증가한다."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 공격 속도가 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 21 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 27 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升33点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 33 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","蚀心碎骨"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","심신 파괴"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","附带“箭毒”的目标的生命值过低时会立即被击败。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","독화살을 맞은 목표의 HP가 매우 낮으면 즉시 처치당한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","附带“箭毒”的目标，若其生命值低于一定阈值，将会立即被击败。阈值等同于“箭毒”每秒原始伤害量的5.2倍。每当一名附带“箭毒”的敌方英雄被击败，阈值额外提高“箭毒”每秒原始伤害量的0.5倍，最多提高2次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","독화살을 맞은 목표는 HP가 일정 한계치보다 낮으면 즉시 처치당한다. 한계치는 독화살 초당 기본 대미지량의 5.2배이다. 독화살을 맞은 적 영웅 1명이 처치당할 때마다 한계치가 독화살 초당 기본 대미지량의 0.5배 증가하며, 최대 2회 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"},{"start":83,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":51,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"},{"start":106,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","阈值等同于“箭毒”每秒原始伤害量的5.7倍。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","한계치가 독화살 초당 기본 대미지량의 5.7배로 된다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","拥有600点初始能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","초기 에너지를 600 보유한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","阈值等同于“箭毒”每秒原始伤害量的6.2倍。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","한계치가 독화살 초당 기본 대미지량의 6.2배로 된다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:original"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“穿心连射”命中附带“箭毒”的目标时，造成的伤害提高。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","연속 관통으로 독화살을 맞은 목표를 명중할 경우, 입히는 대미지가 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若目标附带“箭毒”，则“穿心连射”造成的伤害量提高，提高量相当于当前的“箭毒”每秒伤害量的1.5倍。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","독화살을 맞은 목표에게 연속 관통으로 입히는 대미지량이 증가한다. 증가량은 현재 독화살 초당 대미지량의 1.5배와 같다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛇憩之骨"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","뱀의 안식"]]}